<h2>Why a conversion story belongs in an SEO portfolio</h2>

<p>
  Organic traffic that does not convert is a cost, not an asset. A large part of
  my value to clients has been refusing to stop at the session &mdash; if the
  page the ranking sends people to is poorly constructed, the SEO work is
  subsidizing a leak. These projects are where I learned to think about the
  whole path rather than the acquisition half of it.
</p>

<h2>Landing page templates for ReSound</h2>

<p>
  Audigy's sister company ReSound needed landing page templates for Google Ads
  campaigns. We built an initial set, and after roughly a year of real campaign
  data it was clear there were meaningful opportunities to improve them. I
  completed a full replacement set in February 2023, implemented immediately for
  a client practice.
</p>

<p>
  After independent testing, the in-house paid search team reported back:
</p>

